   "widgets_values": [
    "## Posed Sprite Sheet: minimal run (CPU, no models)\n\nRenders the SCAIL cylinder pose frames of the example short uppercut and pads its side still onto the pose box.\n\n1. **Place the inputs**: copy the workflow bundle's `inputs/tracks/` folder into `ComfyUI/input/` (so `ComfyUI/input/tracks/short_uppercut/fitted/keypoints.json` exists), and load the still `inputs/scail_cop/refs/short_uppercut_side_raw.png` in Load Image (choose file to upload).\n2. **Queue** this graph. CPU only, about 1-2 minutes for the 65 frames.\n3. **Results** in `ComfyUI/output/pss_minimal/`: `pose_*.png` (65 frames, identical to the bundle's `scail_cop/poses/short_uppercut/`) and `padded_*.png` (identical to `scail_cop/refs/short_uppercut_pad.png`). Both go into the SCAIL-Preview workflow: pose frames as the pose video, padded still as the reference image."
   ],
   "title": "Read me"
  }
